==Description==

La commande [[Image:Part_LinkArrayLinear.svg|24px]] '''Part Réseau linéaire de liens''' crée un ensemble de [[App_Link/fr|liens]] à partir d'un objet sélectionné en plaçant des copies selon une répétition linéaire selon une ou deux directions choisies.

Cette commande peut être utilisée sur de nombreux objets 3D, tels que ceux créés à l'aide de l'[[Part_Workbench/fr|atelier Part]], mais aussi sur des instances d'assemblage créées à l'aide de l'[[Assembly_Workbench/fr|atelier Assembly]].

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
== Usage ==
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
# Optionally select one object.
# There are several ways to invoke the command:
#* Press the {{Button|[[Image:Part_LinkArrayLinear.svg|16px]] [[Part_LinkArrayLinear|Linear Link Array]]}} button.
#* Select the {{MenuCommand|Part/Assembly → Link Arrays → [[Image:Part_LinkArrayLinear.svg|16px]] Linear Link Array}} option from the menu.
# The {{MenuCommand|Linear Link Array}} task panel opens. See [[#Options|Options]] for more information.
# If you have not yet selected an object, press the {{Button|Select Object}} button and select one object.
# Enter the required parameters in the task panel.
# Press the {{Button|OK}} button to finish the command.
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
== Options ==
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
* Select the direction from the dropdown list to specify the first axis along which the array will be created. It can be the X-, Y- or Z-axis, or a selected reference. Press the {{Button|Reverse the direction of the pattern}} button to invert the pattern along this axis.
* Select the {{MenuCommand|Mode}} - Extent or Spacing. See the [[PartDesign_LinearPattern#Options|PartDesign LinearPattern]] page for more details.
* Specify the {{MenuCommand|Length}} or {{MenuCommand|Spacing}} and enter the number of {{MenuCommand|Occurrences}}.
* Optionally, check the {{MenuCommand|Direction 2}} box to define a second direction in the same way.
* Press the {{Button|Cancel}} button to abort the command.
</div>


